// Title: Potential Persistence Via PlistBuddy
// Sigma ID: 65d506d3-fcfe-4071-b4b2-bcefe721bbbb
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Sohan G (D4rkCiph3r)
// Date: 2023-02-18 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, persistence, T1543.001, T1543.004
// Description: Detects potential persistence activity using LaunchAgents or LaunchDaemons via the PlistBuddy
//   utility
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://redcanary.com/blog/clipping-silver-sparrows-wings/
//   - https://www.manpagez.com/man/8/PlistBuddy/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_persistence_via_plistbuddy.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/PlistBuddy" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "RunAtLoad" and ProcessCommandLine contains "true") and (ProcessCommandLine contains "LaunchAgents" or ProcessCommandLine contains "LaunchDaemons")
